You become a master of your craft, allowing you to focus on a single tool (currently none) to greatly improve its capabilities:

Grappling Hook (Grappling Hook Mastery)

Your grappling hook deals 100% unarmed damage when it hits, plus a further [97, 117, 132, 145, 156 (TL1-5; CUN 100)] physical and [97, 117, 132, 145, 156 (TL1-5; CUN 100)] nature damage over 4 turns.

Rogue's Brew (Rogue's Brew Mastery)

Your Rogue's Brew fortifies you for 8 turns, preventing you from dying until you reach [-100, -267, -396, -504, -600 (TL1-5)] life.

Dart Launcher (Dart Launcher Mastery)

Your darts ignore poison and sleep immunity and waking targets are slowed by [16%, 25%, 31%, 34%, 37% (TL1-5)] for 4 turns.

Smokescreen (Smokescreen Mastery)

Your Smokescreen is infused with chokedust. Enemies in the smoke take [82, 97, 109, 119, 127 (TL1-5; CUN 100)] nature damage and may be silenced.

Hidden Blades (Assassinate)

You prime your Hidden Blades to cause bleeding and facilitate the Assassinate ability, which allows you to strike twice for [233%, 255%, 272%, 287%, 300% (TL1-5)] unarmed damage, hitting automatically while ignoring armor and resistance.

The effects depend on this talent's level.

Mastering a new tool places it (and its special effects, as appropriate) on cooldown.
